Validates whether required Zowe keystore and truststore exist and meet Zowe's requirements.
This command can be used to prove that Zowe's keystore and truststore are correct before starting zowe.

These Zowe YAML configurations showing with sample values are used:

```yaml
zowe:
  certificate:
    keystore:
      type: JCERACFKS
      file: safkeyring://ZWESVUSR/ZOWERING
      password: password
      alias: IZUDFLT
    truststore:
      type: JCERACFKS
      file: safkeyring://ZWESVUSR/ZOWERING
      password: password
  externalDomains:
    - host1.example.com
    - host2.example.com
java:
  home: /path/to/java
```
